B.bQN=new A.Z("Do timers keep running if the app is closed?","Yes. Time is calculated from the clock, so when Hyde Arena opens again every session catches up and overdue ones raise their alarm.")
B.bPF=new A.Z("Why does a sale after midnight count for yesterday?",'With "Shop open & close" on, everything until you close the shop belongs to the day you opened it. A reminder appears after 12 AM while the shop is still open.')
B.bPG=new A.Z("What happens when the internet is down?","Hyde Arena keeps working for up to 7 days offline, then asks to reconnect to verify the license.")
B.bQJ=new A.Z("How do saved sessions work?",'"Save & exit" frees the console and keeps the remaining time. Resume it later on any free console from the Saved screen.')
B.bPS=new A.Z("Can I undo a deleted transaction?","Yes. Deleted transactions go to Transactions \u2192 Deleted, where they can be restored. Every change is kept in the activity log.")
B.bQk=new A.Z("How do package prices work?","Settings \u2192 Time slots & packages: give a slot a price (30 min = \u20b9100, 1 hour = \u20b9180). An exact package costs its price; other durations are rounded up to the cheapest packages that cover the time, or charged as packages plus the hourly rate, whichever you choose.")
B.bPY=new A.Z("What happens to money paid in advance?","It is recorded the moment it is received and shown as paid. At checkout it is deducted from the bill; whatever the bill did not use is refunded or kept on their wallet.")
B.bQd=new A.Z("How do I get an Excel report of my stock?","Snacks & POS \u2192 Stock & profit \u2192 Export to Excel. The workbook has the summary, every product, every movement (what, when, who), sales, purchases and wastage.")
B.bQ2=new A.Z("How do I keep my data safe?",'A backup is made automatically every day (last 10 kept). Use "Back up to folder" to copy one to a USB drive regularly.')
B.bQC=new A.Z("Keyboard shortcuts","Ctrl+1\u20269 and Ctrl+0 switch screens, Ctrl+L locks the app, Esc closes dialogs.")
